* RO3101A-1 433.92 MHz SAW Oscillator
* Full Netlist - No Schematic Drawing Required

* --- 1. Power Supply ---
V1 VCC 0 5
Cbypass VCC 0 1n  ; RF Bypass

* --- 2. SAW Resonator Model (RO3101A-1) ---
* [cite_start]Values from Datasheet: Rm=19.4, Lm=63.8u, Cm=2.11f, C0=2.4p [cite: 21]
.SUBCKT RO3101A_1 1 2
R1 1 3 19.4
L1 3 4 63.8u
C1 4 2 2.11f
C2 1 2 2.4p
.ENDS RO3101A_1

* --- 3. The Oscillator Circuit ---
* Transistor Q1 (RF NPN)
* Connections: Collector, Base, Emitter
Q1 Coll Base Emit 0 NPN_RF

* [cite_start]Tuning Inductor (55nH matches test fixture) [cite: 21]
L1 VCC Coll 55n

* Feedback Network (Colpitts)
C1 Base Emit 4.7p
C2 Emit 0 5.6p

* Biasing (DC Operation)
Rb VCC Base 33k
Re Emit 0 330

* Connect the SAW Resonator (Base to Ground)
X1 Base 0 RO3101A_1

* --- 4. Simulation Commands ---
* Define the Transistor Model (Generic RF NPN)
.MODEL NPN_RF NPN(Is=1e-15 Bf=100 Cje=1p Cjc=1p Tf=0.1n)

* Transient Analysis: 0 to 2 microseconds, step 0.1ns
.TRAN 0 2u 0 0.1n

* Initial Condition (Kickstart the oscillation)
.IC V(Base)=0.7

.END